\v 4 For they are [impudent]{strong=“H6440 H7186”} \w children| strong="H1121" \w* [and stiffhearted]{strong=“H3820 H2389”}. [I do send]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [thee unto them; and thou shalt say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [unto them, Thus saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the Lord| strong="H136" \w* \sc God\sc*.\f + \fr 2:4 \ft impudent: Heb. hard of face \f* 
