\v 10 [I clothed]{strong=“H3847” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w thee also with broidered work| strong="H7553" \w*, [and shod]{strong=“H5274” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thee with badgers’ skin]{strong=“H8476”}, [and I girded]{strong=“H2280” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee about with fine linen| strong="H8336" \w*, [and I covered]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w thee with silk| strong="H4897" \w*. 
