\v 14 \w And thy renown| strong="H8034" \w* [went forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w among the heathen| strong="H1471" \w* \w for thy beauty| strong="H3308" \w*: for it was \w perfect| strong="H3632" \w* \w through my comeliness| strong="H1926" \w*, [which I had put]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [upon thee, saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w the Lord| strong="H136" \w* \sc God\sc*. 
\p
\v 15 [But thou didst trust]{strong=“H982” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in thine own beauty| strong="H3308" \w*, [and playedst the harlot]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w because of thy renown| strong="H8034" \w*, [and pouredst out]{strong=“H8210” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy fornications| strong="H8457" \w* [on every one that passed by]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}; his it was. 
