\v 18 [And tookest]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy broidered| strong="H7553" \w* \w garments| strong="H899" \w*, [and coveredst]{strong=“H3680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [them: and thou hast set]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w mine oil| strong="H8081" \w* \w and mine incense| strong="H7004" \w* \w before| strong="H6440" \w* them. 
