\v 20 [Moreover thou hast taken]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thy sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w and thy daughters| strong="H1323" \w*, [whom thou hast borne]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [unto me, and these hast thou sacrificed]{strong=“H2076” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto them to be devoured]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}. Is this \w of thy whoredoms| strong="H8457" \w* \w a small matter| strong="H4592" \w*,\f + \fr 16:20 \ft to be…: Heb. to devour \f* 
\v 21 [That thou hast slain]{strong=“H7819” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my children| strong="H1121" \w*, [and delivered]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them to cause them to pass through]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} the fire for them? 
