\v 24 These were [thy merchants]{strong=“H7402” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in all sorts| strong="H4360" \w* of things, \w in blue| strong="H8504" \w* \w clothes| strong="H1545" \w*, \w and broidered work| strong="H7553" \w*, \w and in chests| strong="H1595" \w* \w of rich apparel| strong="H1264" \w*, [bound]{strong=“H2280” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w with cords| strong="H2256" \w*, \w and made of cedar| strong="H729" \w*, \w among thy merchandise| strong="H4819" \w*.\f + \fr 27:24 \ft all…: or, excellent things \f* \f + \fr 27:24 \ft clothes: Heb. foldings \f* 
\v 25 \w The ships| strong="H591" \w* \w of Tarshish| strong="H8659" \w* [did sing]{strong=“H7788” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of thee in thy market| strong="H4627" \w*: [and thou wast replenished]{strong=“H4390” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}, \w and made very| strong="H3966" \w* [glorious]{strong=“H3513” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in the midst| strong="H3820" \w* \w of the seas| strong="H3220" \w*. 
\p
