\v 12 [Yea, I will cause men]{strong=“H120”} [to walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} upon you, even \w my people| strong="H5971" \w* \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; [and they shall possess]{strong=“H3423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [thee, and thou shalt be their inheritance]{strong=“H5159”}, [and thou shalt no more]{strong=“H3254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [henceforth bereave]{strong=“H7921” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} them of men. 
