\v 27 [And I will put]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my spirit| strong="H7307" \w* \w within| strong="H7130" \w* [you, and cause]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [you to walk]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in my statutes| strong="H2706" \w*, [and ye shall keep]{strong=“H8104” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my judgments| strong="H4941" \w*, [and do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} them. 
