\v 29 [I will also save]{strong=“H3467” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w you from all your uncleannesses| strong="H2932" \w*: [and I will call]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w for the corn| strong="H1715" \w*, [and will increase]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [it, and lay]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w no famine| strong="H7458" \w* upon you. 
