\v 20 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} he unto me, This is \w the place| strong="H4725" \w* \w where the priests| strong="H3548" \w* [shall boil]{strong=“H1310” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the trespass offering| strong="H817" \w* \w and the sin offering| strong="H2403" \w*, [where they shall bake]{strong=“H644” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the meat offering| strong="H4503" \w*; [that they bear]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} them \w not out into the utter| strong="H2435" \w* \w court| strong="H2691" \w*, [to sanctify]{strong=“H6942” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w the people| strong="H5971" \w*. 
\v 21 [Then he brought me forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w into the utter| strong="H2435" \w* \w court| strong="H2691" \w*, [and caused me to pass by]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the four| strong="H702" \w* \w corners| strong="H4740" \w* \w of the court| strong="H2691" \w*; [and, behold, in every]{strong=“H4740”} \w corner| strong="H4740" \w* [of the court]{strong=“H2691 H2691”} there was \w a court| strong="H2691" \w*.\f + \fr 46:21 \ft in every…: Heb. a court in a corner of a court, and a court in a corner of a court \f* 
