\v 19 \w And the south| strong="H5045" \w* \w side| strong="H6285" \w* \w southward| strong="H8486" \w*, \w from Tamar| strong="H8559" \w* even \w to the waters| strong="H4325" \w* [of strife]{strong=“H4809 H4808” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8677”} in \w Kadesh| strong="H6946" \w*, \w the river| strong="H5158" \w* \w to the great| strong="H1419" \w* \w sea| strong="H3220" \w*. And this is \w the south| strong="H8486" \w* \w side| strong="H6285" \w* \w southward| strong="H5045" \w*.\f + \fr 47:19 \ft strife: or, Meribah \f* \f + \fr 47:19 \ft river: or, valley \f* \f + \fr 47:19 \ft is the south side southward: or, is the south side toward Teman \f* 
